l on his head you won't be  able to do it again until he heals it  this is his healing animation keep an  eye out for it he can heal all of his  limbs as well so you should pay  attention to this red glow because the  red glow is around the body part he  heals and once he's healed it it means  you can stagger him again if this fight  is done correctly the cleric beast  should spend half his time being  staggered or healing himself making it  very easy for you to keep up your  assault  you'll have plenty of times to he  granted you stay behind him and keep an  eye on his arms at this point the cleric  beast should be below 33% health and  around this point he gets stupidly  aggressive like he attacks non-stop even  if you're nowhere near him use this to  your advantage and move on to step 3  so lock on and back away from the cleric  beast or just sprint away from him and  throughout central yharnam in the first  episode of the guide there was about 10  Molotov cocktails and oil urns that you  should have found in the world  so start lobbing these at the cleric  beast because fire does increase damage  to beasts be careful of his long-range  attacks but that's it this fight should  definitely be over at this point and you  should have killed him in less than 2  minutes so if this helped you please  leave a like and subscribe if you want  to join me for your adventures through  blood-borne the only question I have  with this cleric beast fight is what  exactly does damaging his limbs do I  know it stuns him when you bleed out one  of his limbs and he has to spend time  healing them but I feel like there could  be some subtle effect I haven't noticed  perhaps he does less damage with a  damaged arm or perhaps he can't jump  with a damaged leg or maybe you do more  damage to a damaged limb if you research  this enough and find an answer then just  let everyone know you should head over  to the vexed relief page which have got  listed in the description this is the  page 